From: Tiago Damascena <tiagobdamascena@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 22:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] QUIT: suspend after the box has closed, and no FAST SHUTDOWN (RelicOS)

Seen on the device (M21): SUSPEND SYSTEM > YES puts the console to
sleep with "REALLY SUSPEND?" still on the panel, and that is the frame
it wakes up to, for the second or so before the ES is thawed. The YES
callback runs in the input phase and calls the suspend script
synchronously; the box and the menu are closed by then, but no frame
has been drawn since. Post the call to the UI thread twice: posted
functions run in Window::update, before the frame's render, so the
second hop lands after one whole frame was drawn without them.

FAST SHUTDOWN SYSTEM ("shutdown without saving metadata") is hidden
for RELICOS like it is for KNULLI: nothing in RelicOS needs it, and the
name reads as a promise the console does not keep. "REALLY SUSPEND ?"
loses its stray space.
---
diff -ruN a/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp b/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp
--- a/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp	2026-09-15 21:16:45.111223052 -0300
+++ b/es-app/src/guis/GuiMenu.cpp	2026-09-15 21:16:45.126175217 -0300
@@ -4248,8 +4248,21 @@
 	if (ApiSystem::getInstance()->isScriptingSupported(ApiSystem::SUSPEND))
 	{
 		s->addEntry(_("SUSPEND SYSTEM"), false, [window, s] {
-			window->pushGui(new GuiMsgBox(window, _("REALLY SUSPEND ?"),
-				_("YES"), [s] { s->close(); ApiSystem::getInstance()->suspend(); },
+			window->pushGui(new GuiMsgBox(window, _("REALLY SUSPEND?"),
+				_("YES"), [window, s] {
+					s->close();
+					// The suspend script blocks until the resume, and this
+					// callback runs in the frame's input phase: nothing is
+					// drawn between here and the kernel freezing the ES, so
+					// the frame on the panel when the device wakes up is the
+					// one with the box still on it. Posted functions run in
+					// Window::update, before that frame's render; two hops
+					// place the call after one whole frame has been drawn
+					// without the box and the menu.
+					window->postToUiThread([window] {
+						window->postToUiThread([] { ApiSystem::getInstance()->suspend(); });
+					});
+				},
 				_("NO"), nullptr));
 		}, "iconFastShutdown");
 	}
@@ -4259,7 +4272,7 @@
 			_("YES"), [] { Utils::Platform::quitES(Utils::Platform::QuitMode::SHUTDOWN); },
 			_("NO"), nullptr));
 	}, "iconShutdown");
-#ifndef KNULLI
+#if !defined(KNULLI) && !defined(RELICOS)
 	s->addWithDescription(_("FAST SHUTDOWN SYSTEM"), _("Shutdown without saving metadata."), nullptr, [window] {
 		window->pushGui(new GuiMsgBox(window, _("REALLY SHUTDOWN WITHOUT SAVING METADATA?"),
 			_("YES"), [] { Utils::Platform::quitES(Utils::Platform::QuitMode::FAST_SHUTDOWN); },
